Root cause:
The root cause of the bug was the inclusion of temperature sensor nodes for PMICs (pm8350 and pmr735b) that were not present on the sc7280-idp board. This led to incorrect device tree configurations, which could cause issues in reading temperature data or result in system instability. The patch corrects this by removing the unnecessary nodes and ensuring that only the relevant PMICs are defined in the device tree.
